{"id":10889,"date":"2022-06-15T15:24:32","date_gmt":"2022-06-15T15:24:32","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/?p=10889"},"modified":"2022-06-15T15:24:32","modified_gmt":"2022-06-15T15:24:32","slug":"analyza-vitaminu-c-pomoci-ft-nir-spektroskopie","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/analyza-vitaminu-c-pomoci-ft-nir-spektroskopie\/","title":{"rendered":"Anal\u00fdza vitam\u00ednu C pomoc\u00ed FT-NIR spektroskopie"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><a href=\"https:\/\/cs.wikipedia.org\/wiki\/Kyselina_askorbov%C3%A1\"><strong>Kyselina askorbov\u00e1<\/strong><\/a> (neboli vitam\u00edn C) je jedn\u00edm z\u00a0nejroz\u0161\u00ed\u0159en\u011bj\u0161\u00edch potravinov\u00fdch dopl\u0148k\u016f na sv\u011bt\u011b. Krom\u011b toho, \u017ee je dnes ji\u017e notoricky zn\u00e1mou prevenc\u00ed proti kurd\u011bj\u00edm, je tak\u00e9 d\u016fle\u017eit\u00fdm antioxidantem. Rovn\u011b\u017e se pou\u017e\u00edv\u00e1 v\u00a0potravin\u00e1\u0159sk\u00e9m pr\u016fmyslu jako ochrana nakl\u00e1dan\u00e9ho a mra\u017een\u00e9ho ovoce p\u0159ed hn\u011bdnut\u00edm, p\u0159i v\u00fdrob\u011b plast\u016f jako aditivum v\u00a0polymera\u010dn\u00edch procesech nebo k\u00a0neutralizaci j\u00f3du p\u0159i chemick\u00e9m o\u0161et\u0159ov\u00e1n\u00ed vody. To z\u00a0n\u011bj \u010din\u00ed velmi v\u00fdznamnou l\u00e1tku, jej\u00ed\u017e kvalitu je pot\u0159eba spolehliv\u011b sledovat.<\/p>\n<p>Kyselina askorbov\u00e1 se v\u011bt\u0161inou m\u00edch\u00e1 s\u00a0pomocn\u00fdmi l\u00e1tkami, jako je nap\u0159\u00edklad \u0161krob, kter\u00fd pln\u00ed funkci plniva nebo pojiva v\u00a0z\u00e1vislosti na tom, co je zrovna pot\u0159eba. V\u00a0takov\u00fdch sm\u011bs\u00edch je p\u0159esn\u00e9 stanoven\u00ed obsahu kyseliny askorbov\u00e9 n\u00e1kladnou a zdlouhavou operac\u00ed, kter\u00e1 vy\u017eaduje zku\u0161en\u00fd kvalifikovan\u00fd person\u00e1l a mno\u017estv\u00ed m\u011b\u0159ic\u00edho a laboratorn\u00edho vybaven\u00ed. Tak\u00e9 se p\u0159i takov\u00fdch anal\u00fdz\u00e1ch pou\u017e\u00edvaj\u00ed \u010dasto toxick\u00e9 l\u00e1tky, kter\u00e9 p\u0159edstavuj\u00ed zbyte\u010dnou z\u00e1t\u011b\u017e nejen finan\u010dn\u00ed, ale tak\u00e9 pro \u017eivotn\u00ed prost\u0159ed\u00ed.<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_7820\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-7820\" style=\"width: 400px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-7820 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/05\/6c05e27c.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"385\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/05\/6c05e27c.jpg 400w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/05\/6c05e27c-300x289.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-7820\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">FT-NIR spektrometr <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/antaris-ii\/\">Nicolet Antaris II<\/a><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>Jednou z\u00a0nejelegantn\u011bj\u0161\u00edch metod modern\u00ed anal\u00fdzy je <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/nir-spektroskopie\/\"><strong>FT-NIR spektroskopie<\/strong><\/a> (infra\u010derven\u00e1 spektroskopie v bl\u00edzk\u00e9 oblasti). Je to <strong>rychl\u00e1, jednoduch\u00e1, p\u0159esn\u00e1 a spolehliv\u00e1 metoda<\/strong>, s\u00a0n\u00ed\u017e i neodborn\u00edk z\u00edsk\u00e1 \u00fadaje o koncentraci zkouman\u00e9 l\u00e1tky b\u011bhem <strong>n\u011bkolika vte\u0159in<\/strong>. Spo\u010d\u00edv\u00e1 v\u00a0interakci elektromagnetick\u00e9ho z\u00e1\u0159en\u00ed (infra\u010derven\u00e9ho z\u00e1\u0159en\u00ed) se vzorkem, kter\u00fdm je absorbov\u00e1no na z\u00e1klad\u011b vibrac\u00ed, je\u017e jsou pro ka\u017edou molekulu unik\u00e1tn\u00ed. Je tedy bezkontaktn\u00ed a nedestruktivn\u00ed a d\u00edky vlastnostem NIR z\u00e1\u0159en\u00ed lze m\u011b\u0159it i <strong>p\u0159es \u0159adu obalov\u00fdch materi\u00e1l\u016f<\/strong>. Nav\u00edc nevy\u017eaduje (t\u00e9m\u011b\u0159) \u017e\u00e1dnou \u00fapravu vzorku, a tak \u010dasov\u00e9 i finan\u010dn\u00ed n\u00e1klady na jedno m\u011b\u0159en\u00ed jsou minim\u00e1ln\u00ed.<\/p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-10893 aligncenter\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2022\/06\/04654b2a-694x1024.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"440\" height=\"649\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2022\/06\/04654b2a-694x1024.png 694w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2022\/06\/04654b2a-203x300.png 203w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2022\/06\/04654b2a-768x1133.png 768w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2022\/06\/04654b2a-1041x1536.png 1041w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2022\/06\/04654b2a.png 1061w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 440px) 100vw, 440px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>S programem <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/aplikacni-podpora\/software\/tq-analyst-9\/\"><strong>TQ Analyst<\/strong><\/a> pak m\u016f\u017eete z nam\u011b\u0159en\u00fdch spekter snadno vytvo\u0159it kalibra\u010dn\u00ed model, se kter\u00fdm pak ka\u017ed\u00e1 anal\u00fdza bude ot\u00e1zkou n\u011bkolika vte\u0159in.<\/p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-10895\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2022\/06\/3775c05e-300x204.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"440\" height=\"299\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2022\/06\/3775c05e-300x204.png 300w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2022\/06\/3775c05e-1024x696.png 1024w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2022\/06\/3775c05e-768x522.png 768w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2022\/06\/3775c05e.png 1073w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 440px) 100vw, 440px\" \/><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Kyselina askorbov\u00e1 (neboli vitam\u00edn C) je jedn\u00edm z\u00a0nejroz\u0161\u00ed\u0159en\u011bj\u0161\u00edch potravinov\u00fdch dopl\u0148k\u016f na sv\u011bt\u011b. Krom\u011b toho, \u017ee je dnes ji\u017e notoricky zn\u00e1mou prevenc\u00ed proti kurd\u011bj\u00edm, je tak\u00e9 d\u016fle\u017eit\u00fdm antioxi